3
00:00:06,407 --> 00:00:09,007
(Raj:)Did you guys see there's
an Avengers screening?

4
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,830
(Raj:)Joss Whedon's gonna show
some deleted scenes

5
00:00:10,832 --> 00:00:12,602
(Raj:)and do a question
and answer session.

6
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,530
(Sheldon:)Oh, well, I have
a few questions for him

7
00:00:14,535 --> 00:00:18,235
about the last Avengers movie...
and a whole lot of answers.

8
00:00:18,239 --> 00:00:20,939
(Leonard:)When's the screening?

9
00:00:20,942 --> 00:00:22,942
(Raj:)Uh, it's tonight, but it's
first-come, first-served,

10
00:00:22,944 --> 00:00:24,914
(Raj:)so we should probably get
there early and wait in line.

11
00:00:24,912 --> 00:00:26,882
Let's do it. (chuckles)

12
00:00:26,881 --> 00:00:28,451
(Leonard:)Penny's busy with my mother,
so I'm in.

13
00:00:28,449 --> 00:00:30,079
(Sheldon:)Oh, bad news.

14
00:00:30,084 --> 00:00:32,154
(Sheldon:)Amy's making me go shopping
with her later,

15
00:00:32,153 --> 00:00:34,553
(Sheldon:)so looks like none of us can go.

16
00:00:36,391 --> 00:00:39,691
(Leonard:)You do realize we're allowed
to have fun without you?

17
00:00:39,694 --> 00:00:42,264
(Howard:)In fact, that's usually
the trick to it.

18
00:00:43,931 --> 00:00:45,701
(Howard:)What time do we
need to get there?

19
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,300
Uh, I'd say by 3:00.

20
00:00:47,301 --> 00:00:49,101
(Sheldon:)You're really going without me?

21
00:00:49,103 --> 00:00:50,103
(Leonard:)It's not a big deal.

22
00:00:50,104 --> 00:00:51,404
(Leonard:)Go shopping with Amy,

23
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:52,806
(Leonard:)and we'll save
a spot in line for you.

24
00:00:52,807 --> 00:00:55,877
(Sheldon:)You don't have the authority
to save places in the line.

25
00:00:55,877 --> 00:00:57,177
(Sheldon:)If I do that, I'll be cutting.

26
00:00:57,178 --> 00:00:59,008
(Leonard:)People do it all the time.

27
00:00:59,013 --> 00:01:00,583
(Sheldon:)You know the golden rule
of line etiquette:

28
00:01:00,581 --> 00:01:03,051
“No cuts, no buts,
no coconuts.”

